WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:04.212
NATHAN FIELDER:
 I've been told my personality
 can make people uncomfortable.

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:04.921
Hey!

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:07.215
-How to Make Love All Night.
-Ah, well, you know...

00:00:07.298 --> 00:00:09.509
I think we're gonna get along
pretty well.

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:10.468
(CHUCKLING)

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:13.012
FIELDER: But I've learned that
if you plan for every variable,

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:16.182
a happy outcome doesn't have
to be left to chance.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:18.518
This conversation's
going pretty well.

00:00:18.601 --> 00:00:19.602
Yes...

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:21.938
So, that's no accident.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.399
Everything that's happened
today...

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:26.109
-(DOORBELL RINGS)
-(CHUCKLES)

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.486
-...I've rehearsed it...
-Hey! Hi! Nathan.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:29.571
...dozens of times...

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:30.655
-Oh.
-Uh...

00:00:30.739 --> 00:00:32.323
FIELDER:
 ...in a replica of your home.

00:00:33.074 --> 00:00:36.286
This is what we can do for...
you, you, and you.

00:00:36.786 --> 00:00:38.371
You know, just off the top
of my head,

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:40.373
I would say sure,
let's go with it.

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.916
This is gonna fun.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.126
It will be.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:46.838
FIELDER: My goal is for your
 rehearsal to reflect reality.

00:00:48.798 --> 00:00:50.884
The government
has Sasquatch liaisons.

00:00:50.967 --> 00:00:52.093
-(CHICKEN SQUAWKS)
-(YELLS)

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:53.219
I love you, Daddy!

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:56.014
With this show, if
your performance isn't accurate,

00:00:56.097 --> 00:00:57.432
you could ruin someone's life.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:01.019
This is all sort of absurd.

00:01:01.269 --> 00:01:03.313
-(CRIES)
-Keep him crying. Don't let up.

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:05.231
-Okay.
-I've got to tell you something.

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:06.566
I don't want
to talk to you again.

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:08.651
SPEAKER: Do you find
it's been healthy for you here?

00:01:09.319 --> 00:01:10.195
N...

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:12.489
FIELDER:
Are you sure you wanna do this?

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:14.491
I don't really like
lying to people.

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:15.658
You're a liar!

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:16.743
Yeah, neither do I.

00:01:16.826 --> 00:01:17.827
(BABY CRYING)

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.663
You're Willy Wonka,
and I'm Charlie Bucket.

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:23.374
I'm the bad guy in this?

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:25.418
-Well, but he's a dream maker.
-FIELDER: Okay.

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:27.879
And you're making
some dreams happen.

00:01:27.962 --> 00:01:29.547
But kids died
in the factory?

00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:31.633
Well, they supposedly died.

00:01:31.716 --> 00:01:35.804
I'll read the book again
just to look into it.

